  "question": {
    "text": "A change of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>8</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>mA</mi></math> in the emitter current brings a change of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>7</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>mA</mi></math> in the collector current. The values of <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">α</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">β</mi></math> are",
